# Raw client media: originals stay local or on a shared drive,
# optimized copies go to src/assets (see docs/content-tracker.md).
# Franck does not always drop files in incoming/, so the whole Elements
# tree is ignored by extension, not just that one folder. The PDF brief
# and the voice notes stay tracked: they are small and are the record of
# what the client actually asked for.
Elements/**/*.jpg
Elements/**/*.JPG
Elements/**/*.jpeg
Elements/**/*.JPEG
Elements/**/*.png
Elements/**/*.PNG
Elements/**/*.heic
Elements/**/*.HEIC
Elements/**/*.webp
Elements/**/*.mp4
Elements/**/*.MP4
Elements/**/*.mov
Elements/**/*.MOV
Elements/**/*.svg
Elements/**/*.ai

Elements/incoming/**/*.jpg
Elements/incoming/**/*.JPG
Elements/incoming/**/*.jpeg
Elements/incoming/**/*.JPEG
Elements/incoming/**/*.png
Elements/incoming/**/*.PNG
Elements/incoming/**/*.heic
Elements/incoming/**/*.HEIC
Elements/incoming/**/*.webp
Elements/incoming/**/*.mp4
Elements/incoming/**/*.MP4
Elements/incoming/**/*.mov
Elements/incoming/**/*.MOV

# Clés SSH et secrets, au cas où ils atterriraient ici par erreur
id_*
*.pem
*_key
*_key.pub

# Spec Kit machine-local state (see .specify/.gitignore)
